## Limitations

Checksums establish byte integrity, not the truth of the underlying claims. Some citations have partial or no current access to the original. A pasted statement need not be independent of its original. The later owner explanations are not substitutes for historical messages. The private archives are **not included**.

For exact source-language timestamps, full text of the selected public Persian quotations, and original caveats, see the unchanged `Ario_Evidence_Public_2026-10-23.json`.

