## Appendix E: Privacy Controls and Limits on Publication

The text was freshly composed from selected permitted materials. No earlier chapter, raw archive, or private annex has been appended. The excluded private account is not reproduced by direct quotation, indirect description, identifiable narrative clues, or dedicated references. Security mechanisms, personal contact information, and unnecessary details about third parties have not been republished. Saghar's name appears only to the extent expressly requested by the author to explain the project's origin. O07, concerning private family naming, is excluded from the argument and its details are withheld.

Content screening, labeling, source references, and structural checks do not constitute an absolute scientific or legal guarantee. Complete account histories, complete M12–M13 provenance, the first moment of the initiating motive, every reported occasion of tears, and the reason for the 5,223/5,212 discrepancy remain unresolved. Inaccessibility is reported plainly and no gap is filled with invented material.

This edition does not claim a new DOI, a replacement of v0.4, or a publication that has not actually occurred. The accompanying publication metadata distinguishes preparation, creation of a branch or pull request, a merge to `main`, and a Zenodo deposit. Each must be verified separately.
