# Editorial record — 2026-10-23

- Preserved the received Persian continuation (11 chapters, five appendices) and public evidence matrix without textual edits.
- Produced an English narrative counterpart with the same chapter order, original evidence IDs, chronology, unknowns, and six adversarial cases.
- Produced an English evidence matrix covering all 54 historical entries and 6 additional references, including original-language locators and limitations. Original Persian quotations remain the authoritative text; English paraphrases do not impersonate direct historical quotations.
- Exported print-ready reading copies in PDF and standalone HTML; provided editable Markdown for both languages.
- Prepared Zenodo deposit metadata and explicit review/release notes; no Zenodo deposit or DOI creation occurred.
- Preserved security and privacy exclusions. No frozen Ario source or historical archive was modified. The original PDF/HTML rendering is editorial, not new evidence.

## Known limitations

Complete account chat export is unavailable. Source S03 original was not retrieved in this compilation, although S04 excerpts were checked in the preceding audit. M12–M13 have partial provenance, H01–H06 await contextual adjudication, and 5223 versus 5212 is not reconciled. The English translation is AI-assisted and is not an independent historical witness; review terminology before public use.

